### Description
add utilities to help write e2e tests and a few basic e2e tests cases

E2E tests includes:
1. spec.IngressClassName & `kubernetes.io/ingress.class`
2. `alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/load-balancer-name`
3. `alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/actions.${action-name}`
4. `alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/conditions.${condition-name}`

Changes to framework:
1. make the k8sClient read/write through APIServer directly instead of through cache. Using cache will make tests flacky due to cache sync race conditions.
2. make the logger satisfy httpexpect's reporter interface so we can leverage httpexpect instead of the custom written httpverifier.
3. added a manifest package to build manifests for common applications
4. added a fixture package to create/cleanup k8s resources

